    "canonical_ref": "Ath.ExpFid.2.2.s3",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "word not pronounced nor mental, nor an effluence of the Perfect, nor a dividing of the impassible Essence, nor an issue; but absolutely perfect Son, living and powerful (Heb.",
