    "canonical_ref": "Ath.ExpFid.2.2.s6",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "v. 23): very God of very God, as John says in his general Epistles, ‘And we are in Him that is true, even in His Son Jesus Christ: this is the true God and everlasting life’ (1 Joh.",
